WEBVTT

00:01:27.717 --> 00:01:30.464
and currently,
I sit on the advisory council

00:01:30.488 --> 00:01:33.515
of the Ethiopian Government's
Jobs Creation Commission.

00:01:34.078 --> 00:01:37.989
Now, I'm sure you're wondering
what a doctor-turned-filmmaker,

00:01:38.013 --> 00:01:39.172
not economist,

00:01:39.196 --> 00:01:41.757
is doing working with
the Jobs Creation Commission.

00:01:42.129 --> 00:01:44.937
Well, I believe the creative industries,

00:01:44.961 --> 00:01:48.141
like film and theater,
design and even fashion,

00:01:48.165 --> 00:01:52.515
can promote economic growth
and democratic ideals in any country.

00:01:52.539 --> 00:01:54.040
I've seen it happen,

00:01:54.064 --> 00:01:55.216
I've helped it happen,

00:01:55.240 --> 00:01:57.534
and I'm here to tell you
a little bit more.

00:01:57.558 --> 00:01:59.073
But first, some context.

00:01:59.509 --> 00:02:01.036
Over the past 15 years,